{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1298052-randomly-generating-story-seeds-for-mage","id":1298052,"title":"Randomly Generating Story Seeds for Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-19T15:08:28-07:00","id":1298052,"title":"Randomly Generating Story Seeds for Mage","content":"I'm working on a Storyteller Vault supplement on story seeding which is a method where one uses randomly generated character connections, items, places, and needs to get a story going or add one to a story going. It's based on the method used to get started in Fiasco. A storyteller picks some number of characters and starts randomly generating choices about their relationships until they feel a story falls out.<br /> <br /> Comments in the documents are enabled if anyone has any thoughts or reply here.<br /> <br /> Instructions: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/145UDj6hP9h96p4QaYRVtp2GLm-ZLsDHm4V9mPGHs4oA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> Chart: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1KUYn7aensLrwwIOUqqBC6KFr8PWbKGVwKX6BKLwZd58/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets...it?usp=sharing</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-20T14:25:24-07:00","id":1298192,"title":"","content":"This is a great idea. Fiasco's character generation method is both fast and robust and is good for augmenting other systems. Thanks for doing this, I will likely use it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-23T21:54:27-07:00","id":1299136,"title":"","content":"This looks really cool. Thanks for sharing it.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts on borrowing from other random story generators out there?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-24T23:09:31-07:00","id":1299524,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tytalus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1298052-randomly-generating-story-seeds-for-mage?p=1299136#post1299136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This looks really cool. Thanks for sharing it.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts on borrowing from other random story generators out there?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not familiar. Link? Could be neat, though. :-D<br /> <br /> I wanted to see what I could do from whole cloth and then use Fiasco's licensing to make it available.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T11:48:03-07:00","id":1299668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PhillyCuriosity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1298052-randomly-generating-story-seeds-for-mage?p=1299524#post1299524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not familiar. Link? Could be neat, though. :-D<br /> <br /> I wanted to see what I could do from whole cloth and then use Fiasco's licensing to make it available.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/20798/Mythic-Game-Master-Emulator\" target=\"_blank\">Mythic Game Master Emulator</a>. I've seen a neat chart in a fan made<a href=\"http://&#91;Search domain &#91;url]www.library-of-rain.com/fileserver/arsmagica/solo_adventures_v3.pdf]&#91;/url] https://www.library-of-rain.com/fileserver/arsmagica/solo_adventures_v3.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> &quot;solo&quot; rpg option for Ars Magica</a>, on page 3. It's medieval, but something like that could be made for Mage without too much trouble I think. The supplement as a whole is interesting on how adventures are created.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T12:11:19-07:00","id":1299683,"title":"","content":"Thanks, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2783_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2783\" data-vbnamecard=\"2783\">Tytalus</a> . I'll give these a look-see. I think my first expansion will be some specialty tables so that Technocrats, Nephandi, Werewolves, etc may have some custom tables but this looks swell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}